The CoreML conversion approach (baking ImageNet normalization into the graph,
the rank-0 scalar-cast op overrides, and the antialias-off interpolation /
flattened-meshgrid trace patches) was independently implemented against the
public coremltools APIs. The iacomus/roboflow-weedcrop-edge-demo project
demonstrates the same approach and is acknowledged as prior art, but no code
from it is included here.
